  "title": "Clove-Spiced Plum Jam",
  "description": "When plums are in season, try this recipe for clove-spiced plum jam--it's perfect for sharing with family and friends.",
  "authors": [
    "Madelle"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-08-23T20:05:03-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2020-08-23T20:05:03-04:00",
